{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1297"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge music-stage/pop-rock","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/music-stage__pop-rock.g4.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",682],["-","last"],["+","quietest"],["=",3],["-","the"],["+","these"],["=",1],["-","five"],["+","classics"],["=",1],["-","is"],["+","came"],["=",1],["-","the"],["+","in"],["=",1],["-","quietest."],["+","1993."],["=",107],["+","A younger songwriter carried the tradition into the twenty-first century. For the closing credits of „The Hobbit: The Desolation of Smaug“ (2013), Peter Jackson's second Tolkien prequel, the red-haired English singer-songwriter Ed Sheeran wrote „I See Fire“, a folk ballad sung from the point of view of the dwarves facing the dragon. It was released as a single on 5 November 2013 and charted around the world.\n\n"],["=",139],["+","\n| The Hobbit: The Desolation of Smaug (2013) | I See Fire | Ed Sheeran |"],["=",48]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",642],["-","letzte"],["+","leiseste"],["=",1],["-","der"],["+","dieser"],["=",1],["-","fünf"],["+","Klassiker"],["=",1],["-","ist"],["+","entstand"],["=",1],["-","der"],["+","1993."],["=",1],["-","leiseste. "],["=",96],["+","Ein jüngerer Songwriter trug die Tradition ins 21. Jahrhundert. Für den Abspann von „Der Hobbit: Smaugs Einöde“ (2013), Peter Jacksons zweitem Tolkien-Prequel, schrieb der rothaarige englische Singer-Songwriter Ed Sheeran „I See Fire“, eine Folkballade aus der Sicht der Zwerge, die dem Drachen gegenüberstehen. Sie erschien am 5. November 2013 als Single und kam weltweit in die Charts.\n\n"],["=",139],["+","\n| Der Hobbit: Smaugs Einöde (2013) | I See Fire | Ed Sheeran |"],["=",42]]}]},
